{"4593770": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Entropy Archive", "steam_appid": 4593770, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Entropy Archive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Entropy Archive</strong> is a sci-fi incremental game where you grow, collapse, rebuild, and uncover the hidden structure of a corrupted machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with simple energy production and gradually unlock a deep network of upgrades, expansions, prestige layers, and long-term progression systems. What begins as a small simulation evolves into a recursive archive of forgotten cycles, unstable records, and hidden mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimize your production, trigger collapses at the right moment, and recover deeper layers of the Archive with every run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and scale an ever-growing production system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collapse your progress to gain permanent power</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new mechanics, systems, and progression layers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden content and corrupted archive records</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through expansion-based milestones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play actively or let the system grow while idle</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every reset reveals more. Every cycle leaves a trace.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Entropy Archive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Entropy Archive</strong> is a sci-fi incremental game where you grow, collapse, rebuild, and uncover the hidden structure of a corrupted machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with simple energy production and gradually unlock a deep network of upgrades, expansions, prestige layers, and long-term progression systems. What begins as a small simulation evolves into a recursive archive of forgotten cycles, unstable records, and hidden mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimize your production, trigger collapses at the right moment, and recover deeper layers of the Archive with every run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and scale an ever-growing production system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collapse your progress to gain permanent power</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new mechanics, systems, and progression layers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden content and corrupted archive records</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through expansion-based milestones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play actively or let the system grow while idle</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every reset reveals more. Every cycle leaves a trace.</strong></p>", "short_description": "Uncover a collapsing machine of endless growth, hidden systems, and recursive resets. Generate energy, unlock expansions, recover corrupted records, and descend deeper into the Archive.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4593770/b84dcafa6df1b71d29782c51d548da3b1a085eef/header.jpg?t=1779478893", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4593770/c58df32119a1c3600d41a68d2a7d9d9718bdac85/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1779478893", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4593770/c58df32119a1c3600d41a68d2a7d9d9718bdac85/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1779478893", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 